Your blade drinks in death. Whenever you score a kill with this talent off cooldown, your next [2, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] melee attacks within 6 turns will always critically strike, and you gain [15%, 20%, 24%, 27%, 30% (TL1-5)] critical multiplier for the duration.

Additionally, you gain an extra [1, 2, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] vim per kill.
